			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="part">
	<div class="container text-container">
		<h3 class="text-center start-using"><b><a href="#pricing" class="same-page-link">Start using BitHub</a></b> in three easy steps:</h3>
		<div class="video-wrap top-video">
			<video id="connect-moderate-embed" class="video-js vjs-default-skin" controls preload="auto" width="auto" height="auto" data-setup="{}" poster="/site/images/connect-moderate-embed-cover.png">
