			</video>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="part">
	<div class="container text-container">
		<div class="clearfix steps">

			<div class="step">
				<a href="javascript://" class="play-connect-step"><img src="/site/images/connect.png" alt="Connect social media content" title="Connect social media content"><h2>Connect</h2></a>
				
				<p><a href="javascript://" class="play-connect-step">Connect the content</a> that you produce accross multiple networks.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="step">
				<a href="javascript://" class="play-moderate-step"><img src="/site/images/moderate.png" alt="Moderate social media content" title="Moderate social media content"><h2>Moderate</h2></a>
				
				<p><a href="javascript://" class="play-moderate-step">Set up the moderation</a> rules to keep your content focused.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="step">
				<a href="javascript://" class="play-embed-step"><img src="/site/images/embed.png" alt="Embed social media content" title="Embed social media content"><h2>Embed</h2></a>
				
