		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="part main-part">
	<div class="container text-container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-md-12">
				<hr class="emphasized">
				<p>
					Producing the quality social media content takes time and effort, but it's the only way to connect with your fans. It pays off, your influence is steadily growing, but <b>what do you do with all these retweets and likes</b>?
				</p>
				<div class="emphasized what-if-block">
					<p class="text-center">
						<b>What if you could leverage the power of your social proof<br> to convert your visitors into your customers</b>?
					</p>
				</div>
				<p>
					Use BitHub to unify all your social media content in one place. Strengthen your brand image through the wisdom of crowds and extend your influence.
				</p>
				<p>
					BitHub provides you with an <b>embeddable social hub</b> that collects all the content produced by you and your fans. Use it for:
				</p>
				<ul class="usage clearfix">
					<li>Social hub on your site</li>
					<li>Interactive event wall</li>
					<li>Landing page</li>
					<li>Hash tag contest</li>
					<li>Community showcase</li>
					<li>Activity stream for your project</li>
				</ul>
				<p>Whatever needs you have, BitHub has you covered.</p>
				<p>
					Check out our <a href="#registration" class="same-page-link">pricing and features</a>!
				</p>
				
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-6 col-md-offset-3">
				<h2 class="text-center cta steps-cta">Register your <a href="#registration" class="same-page-link">account!</a> &raquo;</h2>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
